;; topics/backlog.edn — the topic queue the dougaka 企画 Bot drains.
;;
;; One entry per topic. The Bot (loop-yakuwari role :dougaka/episode-planner,
;; provisioned as a Cloud Itonami workforce Bot) takes the FIRST :open entry,
;; writes videos/<slug>.edn in the shape topics/README.md shows, and in the
;; same commit flips this entry to :designed with :design "<slug>". The QA Bot
;; (:dougaka/qa) flips it back to :open with a :qa-note when the design is
;; outside the governor's bounds.
;;
;; This file is NOT a design: videos/ holds designs only (the nightly loop and
;; the designs test read every videos/*.edn as one). Keep it here.
